{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37344","headline":"寄陈少府兼简叔高 · 唐彦谦","name":"寄陈少府兼简叔高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怀人路绝云归海，避俗门深草蔽丘。\n万事渐消闲客梦，一年虚白少年头。\n山螿啼缓从除架，淮鴈来多莫上楼。\n近日邻家有新酿，每逢诗伴得淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}